/* 展开态：瓦片原地长成 6×4（Folia 点一下就是把这块瓦片撑开），标题与元信息一起放大 */
html[data-theme] #page-home #homeRecommended .pod-card.is-peek,
html[data-theme] #page-home #homeRecommended .pod-card.is-playing-tile {
